      "duration": 1.71,
      "text": "of the velocity vector at this point."
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 317.96,
      "end": 319.39,
      "duration": 1.43,
      "text": "So, if it's positive in this case, you"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 319.4,
      "end": 321.83,
      "duration": 2.43,
      "text": "would have this counterclockwise"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 321.84,
