      "duration": 2.11,
      "text": "direction of rotation of the spiral."
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 323.96,
      "end": 326.07,
      "duration": 2.11,
      "text": "Okay, so now we can move on and do the"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 326.08,
