      "text": "parallel to V2, and we would have the"
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "start": 564.36,
      "end": 568.79,
      "duration": 4.43,
      "text": "trajectories"
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "start": 571.55,
      "end": 571.56,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "going toward all the critical points on"
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "start": 571.56,
      "end": 573.27,
      "duration": 1.71,
      "text": "this line. So, in this case, we're in a"
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "start": 573.28,
      "end": 574.95,
      "duration": 1.67,
      "text": "case where we actually don't have one"
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "start": 574.96,
      "end": 576.83,
      "duration": 1.87,
      "text": "localized critical points like in the"
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "start": 576.84,
      "end": 578.75,
      "duration": 1.91,
      "text": "previous case that we saw. We actually"
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "start": 578.76,
      "end": 580.55,
      "duration": 1.79,
      "text": "have a full a whole line of critical"
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "start": 580.56,
      "end": 581.59,
      "duration": 1.03,
      "text": "points."
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "start": 581.6,
      "end": 584.11,
      "duration": 2.51,
      "text": "Okay, so let's move one more point down."
