    {
      "index": 237,
      "start": 584.12,
      "end": 587.43,
      "duration": 3.31,
      "text": "So, here for another value of C, we now"
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "start": 587.44,
      "end": 589.91,
      "duration": 2.47,
      "text": "are in the lower part of the diagram"
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "start": 589.92,
      "end": 592.39,
      "duration": 2.47,
      "text": "where we now have"
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "start": 592.4,
      "end": 594.79,
      "duration": 2.39,
      "text": "two eigenvalues that are again real, but"
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "start": 594.8,
      "end": 596.63,
      "duration": 1.83,
      "text": "now the determinant is negative."
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "start": 596.64,
      "end": 598.27,
      "duration": 1.63,
      "text": "Determinant is the product of the two."
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "start": 598.28,
      "end": 599.51,
      "duration": 1.23,
      "text": "So, basically, you know that one is"
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "start": 599.52,
      "end": 601.71,
      "duration": 2.19,
      "text": "positive and the other one is negative."
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "start": 601.72,
      "end": 604.11,
      "duration": 2.39,
      "text": "Okay? So, for example, here, we would"
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "start": 604.12,
      "end": 606.99,
      "duration": 2.87,
      "text": "have"
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "start": 608.95,
      "end": 608.96,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "uh one"
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "start": 608.96,
      "end": 611.79,
      "duration": 2.83,
      "text": "positive"
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "start": 615.91,
      "end": 615.92,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "the negative eigen uh value."
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "start": 615.92,
      "end": 627.83,
      "duration": 11.91,
      "text": "Oops. Sorry. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "start": 629.27,
      "end": 629.28,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "So, we would have the positive eigen"
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "start": 629.28,
      "end": 631.87,
      "duration": 2.59,
      "text": "value"
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "start": 633.79,
      "end": 633.8,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "and the negative eigen value here. So,"
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "start": 633.8,
      "end": 636.35,
      "duration": 2.55,
      "text": "here again, we're just moving in the"
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "start": 636.36,
      "end": 638.95,
      "duration": 2.59,
      "text": "structure of the of the uh critical"
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "start": 638.96,
      "end": 640.59,
      "duration": 1.63,
      "text": "point. So, we should have a smooth"
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "start": 640.6,
      "end": 643.03,
      "duration": 2.43,
      "text": "transition between the diagrams going"
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "start": 643.04,
      "end": 645.31,
      "duration": 2.27,
      "text": "one to five. And so, here, what we see"
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "start": 645.32,
      "end": 648.47,
      "duration": 3.15,
      "text": "is that we actually have uh the ray that"
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "start": 648.48,
      "end": 650.63,
      "duration": 2.15,
      "text": "uh is basically the stable the space"
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "start": 650.64,
      "end": 653.27,
      "duration": 2.63,
      "text": "stable space here that would uh give us"
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "start": 653.28,
      "end": 653.99,
      "duration": 0.71,
      "text": "the"
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "start": 654.0,
      "end": 655.79,
      "duration": 1.79,
      "text": "uh trajectories going to zero, but it's"
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "start": 655.8,
      "end": 657.03,
      "duration": 1.23,
      "text": "the only"
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "start": 657.04,
      "end": 658.95,
